# Pull request attribution

Every pull request description names the model that wrote the change, the effort if that model has an effort setting, and whether fast mode was used.

Use these plain lines:

Developed with: <model>
Effort: <effort or Not applicable>
Fast mode: on or off

Do not guess. If the task does not name a model, write Unknown.
